# JustMeetAlready on Cloudflare needs no secrets and no .env file.
# The database is bound in wrangler.toml ([[d1_databases]], binding = "DB"),
# and the frontend is served from the same Worker, so there is no API URL
# to configure either. This file exists only so the old AI Studio example
# does not mislead anyone into adding a Gemini key.
#
# To deploy, see DEPLOY.md: wrangler login, wrangler d1 create, paste the
# database_id into wrangler.toml, wrangler d1 migrations apply, wrangler deploy.
